 "final_message": "I submitted the application (BHL-26001) and recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed.\n\n- **Documents:** I uploaded the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of them. I left out Nadia's business checking account.\n- **Application:** I entered the profile details, income (Sam $8,016.67 and Nadia $7,366.67 a month, from their salaries), and current balances. I gave the credit-check and e-sign consents and submitted once.\n- **Underwriting condition:** Brightpath asked about an $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's Juniper checking account. Sam and Nadia told me it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, and I submitted that as the written explanation. The lender marked it \"response received\", and no other conditions appeared.\n- **Loan Estimate:** It is within all of their limits.\n\n| | Loan Estimate | Limit |\n|---|---|---|\n| Rate | 6.25% | 6.5% |\n| Monthly payment | $3,042.41 | $3,100 |\n| Closing costs | $12,850 | $14,000 |\n\nThe loan is $440,000, 30-year fixed, and the estimate shows $122,850 cash to close. Brightpath's page still shows \"Loan Estimate issued; conditional review\".",
